    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i'm just really worried about the hospital bill and he seems like he's sleeping it off, so i don't want to overreact. if i give him some Pedialyte or even just some watered down juice every 15 mins, can i just watch him at home for a few more hours to see if he perks up before i commit to the ER? surely it's not an emergency if he's still breathing okay?",
